---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sponsors | Petty Rich Bey"
  description="The Bey Mirror Media sponsor paddock. Meet our featured partners, discover exclusive codes, and shop through official partner links."
>
  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-[#090909] px-5 py-16 text-zinc-100 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-20" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 34px, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 35px 36px);"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-zinc-300 to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <header class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.5em] text-zinc-400">Bey Mirror Media · Official Partner Paddock</p>
        <h1 class="logo mt-5 text-5xl text-white md:text-7xl">The Sponsor Circuit</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-400 md:text-lg">
          Welcome to the paddock. Meet the brands riding with us, visit their garages, and find your exclusive partner offers.
        </p>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-9 flex max-w-xl items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-700"></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.35em] text-zinc-500">Est. in good company</span>
          <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-700"></span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-14 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111] shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-800 px-5 py-3 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">
          <span>Race day · Partner showcase</span><span>Garage row 01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-6 p-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] md:items-center md:p-10">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.35em] text-zinc-400">The Bey Mirror Media Racing Team</p>
            <h2 class="logo mt-3 text-4xl text-white md:text-5xl">Powered by our partners.</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg leading-7 text-zinc-400">Every great team has a crew behind it. Pull into the garages, discover the featured partners, and support the brands helping fuel the journey.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-zinc-300">
              <span class="border border-zinc-700 px-3 py-2">Official partners</span>
              <span class="border border-zinc-700 px-3 py-2">Exclusive codes</span>
              <span class="border border-zinc-700 px-3 py-2">Pit lane offers</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-950 p-5">
            <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-5 h-8 border-y border-dashed border-zinc-600/70"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-xl">
              <div class="mb-3 flex justify-between text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500"><span>PRB · No. 01</span><span>Partner race division</span></div>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 720 245" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a classic black-and-silver race car with Bey Mirror Media and partner decals" class="w-full">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="carPaint" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#f4f4f4"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#777"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#202020"/></linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <ellipse cx="360" cy="205" rx="285" ry="16" fill="#000" opacity=".65"/>
                <path d="M85 161 L115 133 L224 120 L285 76 Q307 62 350 62 L462 68 Q493 71 524 112 L611 127 L652 158 L642 183 L80 183 Z" fill="url(#carPaint)" stroke="#e5e5e5" stroke-width="4"/>
                <path d="M279 79 Q304 69 350 70 L448 75 Q474 80 495 113 L253 113 Z" fill="#111" stroke="#aaa" stroke-width="3"/>
                <path d="M116 137 L226 126 L250 151 L95 159 Z" fill="#d4d4d4"/>
                <path d="M512 119 L610 135 L635 157 L536 157 Z" fill="#999"/>
                <path d="M92 171 H642" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5"/>
                <path d="M110 185 H635" stroke="#777" stroke-width="5"/>
                <path d="M160 120 L170 91 L186 91 L190 122 M540 115 L558 90 L572 94 L568 124" fill="#222" stroke="#aaa" stroke-width="4"/>
                <circle cx="205" cy="179" r="37" fill="#080808" stroke="#aaa" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="205" cy="179" r="15" fill="#777"/>
                <circle cx="548" cy="179" r="37" fill="#080808" stroke="#aaa" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="548" cy="179" r="15" fill="#777"/>
                <path d="M300 129 H465 L451 160 H292 Z" fill="#101010" stroke="#aaa" stroke-width="2"/>
                <text x="377" y="148" text-anchor="middle" font-size="18" font-family="Georgia,serif" letter-spacing="2" fill="#f4f4f4">BEY MIRROR</text>
                <text x="377" y="159" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" letter-spacing="3" fill="#bbb">MEDIA</text>
                <text x="145" y="153" font-size="12" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-weight="bold" fill="#111">01</text>
                <path d="M88 160 L70 166 L74 177 L94 177 M637 160 L662 166 L657 177 L638 177" fill="#ddd"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="mt-2 flex justify-between text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-500"><span>Classic form · Modern hustle</span><span>PRB racing</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-3">
          <div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-4">
        <div><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.4em] text-zinc-500">Pit lane · Featured garages</p><h2 class="logo mt-2 text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">Meet the Partners</h2></div>
        <span class="hidden text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-600 sm:block">Two garages open</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-[#121212] shadow-xl">
          <div class="relative border-b border-zinc-700 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-700 via-zinc-900 to-black p-7 md:p-9">
            <div class="absolute right-5 top-5 border border-zinc-500/60 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-300">Garage 01</div>
            <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-400 bg-black/60 text-3xl shadow-inner">🧋</div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.35em] text-zinc-300">Official featured partner</p>
            <h3 class="logo mt-2 text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">The Loaded Tea Shop</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-300">Colorful loaded teas made for flavor, energy, and a little fun. Visit the garage and shop the collection with my personal partner code.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 rounded-lg border border-zinc-500/50 bg-black/50 p-4">
              <p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">Driver's partner code</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[.18em] text-white">LEROY00307</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">Enter at checkout</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-500"><span>Team sponsor decal</span><span>No. 01 · PRB</span></div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <div><p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">Race-day partner</p><p class="logo mt-1 text-xl text-white">THE LOADED TEA SHOP</p></div>
                <span class="border border-zinc-600 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-zinc-300">01</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.theloadedteashop.com/LEROY00307" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center border border-zinc-300 bg-zinc-100 px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-black transition hover:bg-white">Visit The Loaded Tea Shop →</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-[#121212] shadow-xl">
          <div class="relative border-b border-zinc-700 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-700 via-zinc-900 to-black p-7 md:p-9">
            <div class="absolute right-5 top-5 border border-zinc-500/60 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-300">Garage 02</div>
            <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-400 bg-black/60 text-3xl shadow-inner">⚡</div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.35em] text-zinc-300">Official featured partner</p>
            <h3 class="logo mt-2 text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">Dubby Energy</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-300">Energy and focus products for creators, gamers, streamers, and anybody ready to get the task done.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 rounded-lg border border-zinc-500/50 bg-black/50 p-4">
              <p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">Driver's partner code</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[.18em] text-white">ANEpod</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">Use my code when shopping Dubby</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-zinc-500"><span>Team sponsor decal</span><span>No. 02 · PRB</span></div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <div><p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">Race-day partner</p><p class="logo mt-1 text-xl text-white">DUBBY ENERGY</p></div>
                <span class="border border-zinc-600 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-zinc-300">02</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://www.dubby.gg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center border border-zinc-300 bg-zinc-100 px-6 py-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-black transition hover:bg-white">Visit Dubby Energy →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="mt-16 grid gap-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111] md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]">
        <div class="p-7 md:p-10">
          <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.4em] text-zinc-500">Trackside feature · Garage 01</p>
          <h2 class="logo mt-3 text-4xl text-white md:text-5xl">Fuel Your Day</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Take The Loaded Tea Shop along for the ride. Explore the flavors, build a bundle, and use the partner code at checkout.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 inline-block border border-zinc-600 bg-black px-5 py-4">
            <p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-zinc-500">Your pit-pass code</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-white">LEROY00307</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-t border-zinc-700 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-black p-8 text-center md:border-l md:border-t-0">
          <div class="text-5xl">🏁</div>
          <p class="logo mt-4 text-2xl text-white">Make a pit stop</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">Build a bundle · Use your code · Enjoy the ride</p>
          <a href="https://www.theloadedteashop.com/LEROY00307" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full max-w-xs items-center justify-center bg-zinc-100 px-5 py-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-black transition hover:bg-white">Shop The Loaded Tea Shop →</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-14 border-y border-zinc-800 py-10 text-center">
        <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.4em] text-zinc-500">A note from the team</p>
        <h2 class="logo mt-3 text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">Good partners make the journey.</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-400">
          Some links on this page are affiliate or partner links. I may earn a commission when you purchase through my link or use my code, at no additional cost to you. Thank you for supporting the brands that support the work.
        </p>
      </section>
      <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.35em] text-zinc-600"><span>BEY MIRROR MEDIA</span><span>·</span><span>Official sponsor paddock</span><span>·</span><span>End of pit lane</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
